WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.284
Download the ZIP and extract it anywhere: a USB drive, a synced folder or Documents.

2
00:00:06.883 --> 00:00:13.689
The layout follows PortableApps.com Format 3.9, so the PortableApps.com Platform can list and update it.

3
00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:20.225
Double-click VERIGAPortable.exe. The launcher picks the x64 or ARM64 build automatically.

4
00:00:20.817 --> 00:00:28.295
Everything you create stays in the Data folder: the launcher does not write to the registry or leave traces on the host PC.

5
00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:35.833
To move or back up VERIGA, copy the VERIGAPortable folder: settings and history travel with it.

6
00:00:36.483 --> 00:00:42.377
The command-line tool is App\VERIGA\veriga.exe; help.html opens the manual in 8 languages.

7
00:00:43.017 --> 00:00:50.879
The official .paf.exe installer is built with PortableApps.com Installer on Windows. This tutorial illustrates the package layout.

